  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Setup & Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/status",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/status",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "status"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Health check. Returns 200 if the backend is reachable."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /v2/sdk/config \u2014 apiKey sanity check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v2/sdk/config?apiKey={{apiKey}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v2",
                "sdk",
                "config"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "apiKey",
                  "value": "{{apiKey}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Validates your apiKey and that the backend supports v2. Expect 200 with the multi-sponsor bootstrap payload."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. SDK Bootstrap v2",
      "description": "The new init flow. SDK calls these once when a host app starts.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /v2/sdk/config (primary + secondary sponsors)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v2/sdk/config",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v2",
                "sdk",
                "config"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Response shape:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"endpoints\": { \"webSocketBase\", \"commerceGraphQL\" },\n  \"campaign\": { \"id\", \"name\", \"logo\", \"isActive\", \"isPaused\", \"startDate\", \"endDate\" },\n  \"primarySponsor\": { \"id\", \"name\", \"logoUrl\", \"primaryColor\", \"secondaryColor\", \"commerce\": { \"apiKey\", \"channelId\", \"paymentMethods\": [] } | null },\n  \"secondarySponsors\": [ ... ],\n  \"features\": { \"shoppable\", \"lineup\" }\n}\n```\n\nEach sponsor's commerce block is nullable \u2014 visual-only sponsors have `commerce: null`."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. SDK v2 \u2014 Per-broadcast",
      "description": "Called when the user enters a specific broadcast.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /v2/sdk/broadcasts/{id}/capabilities",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v2/sdk/broadcasts/{{broadcastId}}/capabilities",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v2",
                "sdk",
                "broadcasts",
                "{{broadcastId}}",
                "capabilities"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Capability map:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"broadcastId\", \"campaignId\",\n  \"engagement\": { \"enabled\", \"hasPolls\", \"hasContests\" },\n  \"shoppable\": { \"enabled\" },\n  \"lineup\": { \"available\" }\n}\n```\n\nSDK uses this to decide what to subscribe to and what to load into memory."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /v2/sdk/broadcasts/{id}/components",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v2/sdk/broadcasts/{{broadcastId}}/components",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v2",
                "sdk",
                "broadcasts",
                "{{broadcastId}}",
                "components"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Returns campaign-scoped + broadcast-scoped placements. Each entry has:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\", \"campaignComponentId\",\n  \"type\": \"banner|countdown|carousel_*|product_spotlight|...\",\n  \"locationId\",\n  \"sponsor\": { \"id\", \"name\", \"logoUrl\", \"primaryColor\" },\n  \"commerce\": { \"apiKey\", \"channelId\" } | null,\n  \"config\": { ... }\n}\n```\n\nSDK uses `commerce.apiKey` per component to call Commerce GraphQL directly (model d3)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. TV session",
      "description": "TV SDK lifecycle. Prefer `POST /api/sdk/tv/broadcast/subscribe` for the combined bootstrap (validate + session + sponsors in one call). Individual session/start is still available when you only need to register a TV without binding to a broadcast.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /api/sdk/tv/broadcast/subscribe (combined bootstrap)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"broadcastId\": \"{{broadcastId}}\",\n  \"externalUserId\": \"{{externalUserId}}\",\n  \"tvDeviceId\": \"{{tvDeviceId}}\",\n  \"platform\": \"{{tvPlatform}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/sdk/tv/broadcast/subscribe",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "sdk",
                "tv",
                "broadcast",
                "subscribe"
              ]
            },
            "description": "One request that replaces three:\n- validates the partner-provided `broadcastId` against Vio's DB for this client_app\n- ensures the `end_users` row exists for (clientApp, externalUserId)\n- upserts the tv_sessions row\n- returns campaign + primary/secondary sponsors with their commerce blocks + wsUrl + capabilities\n\nIf the broadcast is unknown or cross-tenant, responds 200 with `{ subscribed: false, reason }` so the SDK can silently skip.\n\nTry it:\n1. Happy path (TV2 broadcast + TV2 apiKey): use defaults\n2. Unknown broadcast: set `{{broadcastId}}` to `broadcast-does-not-exist`\n3. Cross-tenant (Viaplay broadcast with TV2 apiKey): use `paris-saint-germain-vs-chelsea-2026-03-11`\n4. TV not enabled: swap `{{apiKey}}` to VG's (tv_enabled=false on that client_app)"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Auto-capture sessionId + endUserId when backend accepts the broadcast.",
                  "// Lets you run heartbeat / end / cart-intent without copy-pasting ids.",
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "try {",
                  "  const r = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (r.subscribed) {",
                  "    if (r.sessionId)  pm.collectionVariables.set('sessionId',  String(r.sessionId));",
                  "    if (r.endUserId)  pm.collectionVariables.set('endUserId',  String(r.endUserId));",
                  "    if (r.campaignId) pm.collectionVariables.set('campaignId', String(r.campaignId));",
                  "    console.log('[subscribe] captured sessionId=' + r.sessionId + ' endUserId=' + r.endUserId);",
                  "  } else {",
                  "    console.log('[subscribe] soft-miss:', r.reason);",
                  "  }",
                  "} catch (e) { console.error('parse error', e); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/sdk/tv/broadcast/subscribe \u2014 UNKNOWN broadcast (soft-miss)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/sdk/tv/broadcast/subscribe",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "sdk",
                "tv",
                "broadcast",
                "subscribe"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"broadcastId\": \"broadcast-no-existe-demo\",\n  \"externalUserId\": \"{{externalUserId}}\",\n  \"platform\": \"{{tvPlatform}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Simulates the Apple TV demo's orange card. Backend responds `{ subscribed: false, reason: \"broadcast_not_registered_for_client_app\" }`. The SDK never opens the WS on this response \u2014 use this to verify the partner app doesn't crash and that `onSubscriptionFailed` fires."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('subscribed is false', () => {",
                  "  const r = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(r.subscribed).to.eql(false);",
                  "  pm.expect(r.reason).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  console.log('[soft-miss] reason=' + r.reason);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/sdk/tv/session/start",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"externalUserId\": \"{{externalUserId}}\",\n  \"tvDeviceId\": \"{{tvDeviceId}}\",\n  \"platform\": \"{{tvPlatform}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/sdk/tv/session/start",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "sdk",
                "tv",
                "session",
                "start"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Registers (or refreshes) the TV session. Ensures the `end_users` row for (clientApp, externalUserId) exists. Returns `sessionId` \u2014 save it into the `sessionId` collection variable for the next requests.\n\n**Capabilities**: `shoppable = clientApp.tv_enabled && platform in tv_platforms` (or unrestricted if no platforms configured)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/sdk/tv/session/heartbeat",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"sessionId\": {{sessionId}}\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/sdk/tv/session/heartbeat",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "sdk",
                "tv",
                "session",
                "heartbeat"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Bumps `last_seen_at`. Call every ~60s from the SDK."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/sdk/tv/session/end",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"sessionId\": {{sessionId}}\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/sdk/tv/session/end",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "sdk",
                "tv",
                "session",
                "end"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Marks `ended_at`. Optional \u2014 sessions also time out by inactivity via cron."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Cart Intent",
      "description": "User click-to-buy. Both endpoints persist a `cart_intents` row. Carry `activationId` to close the attribution chain from a preceding shoppable_ad dispatch.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /api/sdk/tv/cart-intent (TV \u2014 with attribution)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"externalUserId\": \"{{externalUserId}}\",\n  \"productId\": \"{{productId}}\",\n  \"campaignId\": {{campaignId}},\n  \"activationId\": {{activationId}},\n  \"sponsorId\": {{sponsorId}},\n  \"platform\": \"{{tvPlatform}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/sdk/tv/cart-intent",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "sdk",
                "tv",
                "cart-intent"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Called by the TV SDK when the user presses the remote on a shoppable_ad popup. The `activationId` (from the preceding WS event) is persisted as `source_activation_id` on the cart_intent row, giving us the TV\u2192Mobile\u2192Purchase attribution chain."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/campaigns/{id}/cart-intent (Mobile \u2014 with activation)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userId\": \"{{externalUserId}}\",\n  \"productId\": \"{{productId}}\",\n  \"productName\": \"Acme Sneakers\",\n  \"activationId\": {{activationId}},\n  \"sponsorId\": {{sponsorId}}\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/cart-intent",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "campaigns",
                "{{campaignId}}",
                "cart-intent"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Also persists now. Delivery modes: `websocket | dual | webhook | apns | dropped`. Response includes `cartIntentId` for correlation."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/campaigns/{id}/register-device",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userId\": \"{{externalUserId}}\",\n  \"deviceId\": \"device-uuid-1\",\n  \"deviceToken\": \"apns-hex-token-64chars\",\n  \"platform\": \"ios\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/register-device",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "campaigns",
                "{{campaignId}}",
                "register-device"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Register APNs / FCM device token for push delivery."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Shoppable Ads",
      "description": "Four dispatch entry points (all persist to shoppable_ad_activations + fan out a WS event of type `shoppable_ad`) + audit list. Each validates that `sponsorId` belongs to the campaign (primary or secondary).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /api/broadcasts/{id}/trigger-shoppable-ad (dashboard)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"productId\": \"{{productId}}\",\n  \"sponsorId\": {{sponsorId}}\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/broadcasts/{{broadcastId}}/trigger-shoppable-ad",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "broadcasts",
                "{{broadcastId}}",
                "trigger-shoppable-ad"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Dashboard Quick Fire. No auth. Persists `source='dashboard'`. Response includes `activationId` \u2014 save it for chained cart_intent tests."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Capture activationId so the TV cart-intent call below can close the attribution chain.",
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "try {",
                  "  const r = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (r.activationId) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('activationId', String(r.activationId));",
                  "    console.log('[trigger-shoppable-ad] activationId=' + r.activationId);",
                  "  }",
                  "} catch (e) { console.error('parse error', e); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/sdk/tv/broadcasts/{id}/shoppable-ad (TV SDK)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"productId\": \"{{productId}}\",\n  \"sponsorId\": {{sponsorId}}\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/sdk/tv/broadcasts/{{broadcastId}}/shoppable-ad",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "sdk",
                "tv",
                "broadcasts",
                "{{broadcastId}}",
                "shoppable-ad"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Persists `source='tv-sdk'` + `client_app_id` from the apiKey."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "try {",
                  "  const r = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (r.activationId) pm.collectionVariables.set('activationId', String(r.activationId));",
                  "} catch (e) {}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/broadcasts/{id}/shoppable-ad (Bearer admin)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{adminBearer}}",
                  "type": "string"
